flowchart LR
    DR[Developer request] --> SP[Slash command or prompt]
    SP --> AG[Agent]
    AG --> SSC[Steering + Skills + Context]
    AG --> OSA[Optional subagents]
    AG --> SPT[Specs / Plans / Tasks]
    SPT --> IA[Implementation / Artifacts]
    IA --> VER[Verification]
    VER --> REV[Review]
    REV --> DRO[Durable repo output]
